     4	GUI-Owl on :8092 is left alone), and starts two identical MAI-UI Q8_0 servers on :8093 and :8094 with the flags of
     5	MAI-UI's AndroidWorld arm (scripts/local_maiui_aw.sh) plus --cache-ram 0 as on the GUI-Owl MobileWorld server.
     6	The existing reverse tunnel (tunnel_loop.sh) already forwards 18093 -> :8093 and 18094 -> :8094 on the env host.
     7	Set DRY = True to only print what would be stopped.
