     2	
     3	Used identically by: training-data builder, offline AndroidControl eval, and the
     4	AndroidWorld agent, so train/test prompts can never drift apart.
     5	
     6	Design (on-device first):
     7	  * one screenshot per step (current screen only) -> bounded prefill cost on phones
     8	  * text history of previous step intents + actions (last HISTORY_STEPS)
     9	  * coordinates are integers normalized to [0, 1000] (LFM3-VL's native point_2d grid)
    10	  * assistant output = short intent in the <think> block + one compact JSON action
    11	"""
