+5. **[P2 — observed protocol mismatch] “ONE more attempt” is implemented as one invocation permitting four attempts.**
+
+   **Evidence.** The rule specifies one additional attempt after a fresh-container restart: [PREREG_v4.md:156](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/docs/PREREG_v4.md:156). All resume branches retain `--auto_retry 3`: [gcp_mw_resume_vm.sh:23](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/scripts/gcp_mw_resume_vm.sh:23), [v4:28](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/scripts/gcp_mw_resume_vm.sh:28), [MAI-UI:35](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/scripts/gcp_mw_resume_vm.sh:35). MW interprets this as `1 + auto_retry` executions, not three total: [runner.py:303](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/tools/MobileWorld/src/mobile_world/core/runner.py:303).
+
+   The v4 manifest records one resume decision ([manifest:1](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/mobileworld/traj_r2/_retry_manifest_v4.jsonl:1)), but it produced **four** additional Thanksgiving executions starting at 19:51:16, 19:51:23, 19:51:30 and 19:51:37 UTC: [first:1](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/mobileworld/traj_r2/v4_gui_en_r2/ThanksgivingPrepTask_backup_20261118_195123/thread_125037903306880.log:1), [second:1](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/mobileworld/traj_r2/v4_gui_en_r2/ThanksgivingPrepTask_backup_20261118_195130/thread_125037903306880.log:1), [third:1](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/mobileworld/traj_r2/v4_gui_en_r2/ThanksgivingPrepTask_backup_20261118_195137/thread_125037903306880.log:1), [fourth:1](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/mobileworld/traj_r2/v4_gui_en_r2/ThanksgivingPrepTask/thread_125037903306880.log:1). Thus v4 has eight failed Thanksgiving executions, not four original plus one extra. Only the batch starts immediately after the container restart.
+
+   **Fix.** Record this as a deviation/clarification: the implemented allowance is one additional **invocation** with up to four executions. If the intended future rule is literally one execution, run the environment-retry queue with `--auto_retry 0` and handle never-started work separately. Do not silently alter only the pending GUI-Owl allowance after v4 received four: retain equal treatment for this comparison or label any change explicitly. The observed extra v4 attempts added no success.
