+6. **[P2 — observed upstream harness bug] GUI-Owl's parse-failure sentinel is rejected before it can terminate and be scored.**
+
+   **Evidence.** After five failed parses, the official agent returns `JSONAction(action_type=ENV_FAIL)` ([gui_owl_1_5.py:497](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/tools/MobileWorld/src/mobile_world/agents/implementations/gui_owl_1_5.py:497)); `ENV_FAIL` is `error_env`, but is absent from `_ACTION_TYPES`, so validation raises ([models.py:27](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/tools/MobileWorld/src/mobile_world/runtime/utils/models.py:27), [allowed values:34](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/tools/MobileWorld/src/mobile_world/runtime/utils/models.py:34), [validator:131](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/tools/MobileWorld/src/mobile_world/runtime/utils/models.py:131)). The runner already has a normal terminal branch for this sentinel ([runner.py:86](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/tools/MobileWorld/src/mobile_world/core/runner.py:86)), but construction fails first.
+
+   This is present in the raw failed attempts for **ReadQwen3PaperTask5** ([traceback:552](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/mobileworld/traj_r2/guiowl_gui_en_r2/ReadQwen3PaperTask5_backup_20261118_195606/thread_140161534165120.log:552)) and **MastodonCreateMemoTask** ([validation error:1719](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/mobileworld/traj_r2/guiowl_gui_en_r2/MastodonCreateMemoTask_backup_20261118_194824/thread_140161534165120.log:1719)). Both received another task execution instead of the intended terminal scoring. Both ultimately scored zero. This is more precise than attributing the whole exception to model output: malformed output triggered an additional harness defect.
+
+   **Fix.** For a separately versioned future harness, accept `ENV_FAIL` as a terminal action, or return a supported terminal sentinel and record the parse failure explicitly. Check the termination/scoring path without granting an extra task attempt. Keep the historical two retries in run 2's inventory; do not rewrite their outcomes or patch only one arm mid-comparison.
