+
+   **Fix.** Generate `provisional`, per-arm completion state, snapshot identity and pending eligible tasks into both comparison artifacts. Label every headline and paired statistic provisional until the pending allowance is resolved. With v4 fixed at six, the final GUI-Owl score can presently be **22 or 23/105**; the corresponding exact p-values are **1/32768** or **1/65536**. This uncertainty cannot reverse the observed ordering, but it prevents calling the present aggregate final.
