+8. **[P3 — reporting precision] Correct the displayed percentage and distinguish adapter rejection from runtime support.**
+
+   **Evidence.** `22/105 = 20.95238%`, which rounds to **21.0%**, not the MD's 20.9%. The summarizer rounds the rate to four decimals and then rounds again for display: [mw_summarize_r2.py:89](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/scripts/mw_summarize_r2.py:89), [display:129](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/scripts/mw_summarize_r2.py:129), [MD:6](/Users/alpha/lfm3-android/results/mobileworld/mw_r2_comparison.md:6).
